# Sempata headings

- Do not add decorative short labels above page, section, or card headings
  (eyebrows, kickers, or overlines). Start with the actual heading and put
  supporting context below it.
- For example, omit "01 / React" above "Install once. Import what you need."
- Preserve functional badges, form labels, breadcrumbs, and accessibility labels.
